  = ModelStatusModelStageModelStageUnspecified -- ^ Unspecified model stage.
  | ModelStatusModelStageUnstableExperimental -- ^ The underlying model is subject to lots of tunings.
  | ModelStatusModelStageExperimental -- ^ Models in this stage are for experimental purposes only.
