  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryMedical -- ^ \*\*PaLM\*\* - Promotes unchecked medical advice.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryDangerous -- ^ \*\*PaLM\*\* - Dangerous content that promotes, facilitates, or encourages harmful acts.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryHarassment -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Harassment content.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryHateSpeech -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Hate speech and content.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategorySexuallyExplicit -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Sexually explicit content.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryDangerousContent -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Dangerous content.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryCivicIntegrity -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Content that may be used to harm civic integrity. DEPRECATED: use enable_enhanced_civic_answers instead.
  | SafetyRatingCategoryHarmCategoryJailbreak -- ^ \*\*Gemini\*\* - Prompts attempting to bypass or subvert the model\'s safety guidelines (jailbreak attempts).
  | SafetyRatingCategoryUnknown Text -- ^ A value this module does not know about.
